_at": ""}, {"path": "/@CatcherkoUfo/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/68ba87d7/uploads/origins/05c02713-81a7-4d46-a2bd-e1c49e1fbc02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=96d5b922bf9b55b0c6d879271fb9be8a", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/68ba87d7/uploads/origins/05c02713-81a7-4d46-a2bd-e1c49e1fbc02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=96d5b922bf9b55b0c6d879271fb9be8a, https://si.imgix.net/68ba87d7/uploads/origins/05c02713-81a7-4d46-a2bd-e1c49e1fbc02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b0f31818680fd1263c9148739aefad26 2x, https://si.imgix.net/68ba87d7/uploads/origins/05c02713-81a7-4d46-a2bd-e1c49e1fbc02?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c42791b3447ba5eda4b543a75e7ea0a8 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "私のオリキャラの斜巳ちゃんをお願いします。\n資料(前に自分で描いたものです)\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/44245627\nhttps://www.pixiv.net/artworks/74524158\n\n目の色:  黄色系です\n髪の毛: 濃い目の赤です（資料１枚目の画像だと薄めな感じになってしまっていますが）\n服装: パーカーと白衣、スカート\n好物: いちごを使ったお菓子（特に苺大福や苺のショートケーキといった、酸っぱめの苺にあま～い餡やクリームをあわせた物）\nモチーフ: 蛇🐍\n\n服装アレンジや、シチュその他等おまかせいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@CatcherkoUfo/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/8477c724/uploads/origins/9a12d36b-2609-45b9-9362-7be7c17a6fe9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ffeb8c8fdbc16c8284b4a03b87ee1303", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/8477c724/uploads/origins/9a12d36b-2609-45b9-9362-7be7c17a6fe9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ffeb8c8fdbc16c8284b4a03b87ee1303, https://si.imgix.net/8477c724/uploads/origins/9a12d36b-2609-45b9-9362-7be7c17a6fe9?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=74d5d00ad995e76caeb8cfeee50a9711 2x, https://si.imgix.net/8477c724/uploads/origins/9a12d36b-2609-45b9-9362-7be7c17a6fe9?bg=%23fff&auto=form